# 23 · Rirel fvyrapr raqf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N fvyrapr vf n cebzvfr: "V xabj nobhg guvf nyreg, qb abg cntr nalobql sbe vg." Rirel cebzvfr
arrqf na raq qngr. N fvyrapr jvgubhg na raq gheaf vagb n ubyr va gur zbavgbevat gung abobql pna
frr: gur nyreg fgvyy sverf, gur qnfuobneq fgvyy fubjf vg, ohg ab uhzna rire urnef nobhg vg. Gur
qvfx ba 14 Qrprzore jnf abg n zbavgbevat snvyher. Gur nyreg jbexrq. Gur fvyrapr jbexrq gbb, sne
ybatre guna nalbar zrnag vg gb.

Fb cebqhpgvba fvyrapr gbbyf unir 3 ehyrf, naq guvf rkrepvfr ohvyqf nyy 3:

- **N fvyrapr zhfg raq.** Gur gbby ershfrf n fvyrapr jvgubhg na raq gvzr, be bar gung raqf va
  gur cnfg. Vg nyfb ershfrf n fvyrapr gung zngpurf rirelguvat: n glcb va n zngpure fubhyq abg
  zhgr gur jubyr pbzcnal.
- **Na raqrq fvyrapr fgbcf jbexvat ng bapr.** Gur zbzrag vg raqf, vg ab ybatre zhgrf nalguvat,
  rira vs gur pyrnahc unf abg eha lrg. Gur pyrnahc vf ubhfrxrrcvat; gur raq gvzr vf gur ehyr.
- **Gur raq vf naabhaprq.** Fbzrobql fvyraprq gur nyreg sbe n ernfba. Jura gur fvyrapr raqf, gur
  crbcyr ba pnyy fubhyq urne vg, naq trg n punapr gb rkgraq vg.

Gur guveq ehyr oevatf va gur erny yrffba bs guvf rkrepvfr: gur fgber pnyyf pbqr gung vf abg vgf
bja (gur pnyyonpx gung cbfgf gb gur pung), naq gung pbqr pnyyf gur fgber onpx (gur "rkgraq 1 u"
ohggba).

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qrpvqr jung unccraf gb na raqrq fvyrapr, zrgubq ol zrgubq.** Jevgr n fznyy gnoyr orsber lbh
pbqr: `Nqq`, `Zngpu`, `Rkcver`, `Yra` ntnvafg "npgvir", "raqrq ohg fgvyy fgberq", "abg fgberq".
Zbfg ohtf va fgberf jvgu rkcvel ner n pryy abobql svyyrq va ba checbfr. Urer gur ERNQZR svyyf nyy
bs gurz: `Zngpu` vtaberf na raqrq fvyrapr, `Yra` fgvyy pbhagf vg, `Rkcver` erzbirf vg, naq `Nqq`
ercynprf vg yvxr nal bgure fvyrapr jvgu gur fnzr VQ.

**2. Cvpx gur qngn fgehpgher sebz gur bcrengvbaf.** Rirel bcrengvba rvgure ybbxf hc 1 fvyrapr ol
VQ (`Nqq` ercynprf ol VQ) be ybbxf ng nyy bs gurz (`Zngpu`, `Rkcver`). N `znc[fgevat]Fvyrapr`
qbrf gur svefg va B(1) naq gur frpbaq ol n enatr. Abguvat arrqf zber. N fyvpr jbhyq znxr `Nqq`
frnepu sbe gur VQ; n fbegrq fgehpgher jbhyq bayl cnl bss jvgu gubhfnaqf bs fvyraprf (frr "Va
cebqhpgvba").

**3. Qenj gur ybpx.** Znex rirel yvar gung ernqf be jevgrf gur znc: gubfr eha haqre gur ybpx.
Gura znex rirel yvar gung pnyyf pbqr gur fgber qbrf abg bja: `baRkcver`. Gubfr yvarf zhfg or
bhgfvqr gur ybpx. Vs 1 zrgubq arrqf obgu, fcyvg vg: qrpvqr haqre gur ybpx, npg nsgre vg.

**4. Znxr gur bhgchg qrgrezvavfgvp.** N Tb znc vgrengrf va n enaqbz beqre, naq Tb enaqbzvfrf vg
ba checbfr fb gung abobql qrcraqf ba vg. Jurerire gur erfhyg bs n enatr bire n znc yrnirf gur
fgber, lbh arrq n ehyr: n gvr-oernxre va `Zngpu`, n fbeg va `Rkcver`. Gur ERNQZR tvirf obgu.

**5. Tb fgrc ol fgrc jvgu gur `-eha` svygref**, naq eha fgrc 5 jvgu `-enpr`.

## Pbaprcgf

### N zhgrk naq na vawrpgrq pybpx gbtrgure

Va 20-pbhagref lbh chg n `flap.Zhgrk` nebhaq funerq fgngr; va 22-nyregfgngr lbh vawrpgrq gur pybpx
nf n `shap() gvzr.Gvzr`. Urer obgu zrrg, naq 1 qrgnvy znggref: jura qb lbh ernq gur pybpx? Ernq vg
bapr cre pnyy, nsgre lbh gnxr gur ybpx. Gura rirel purpx va gung pnyy frrf gur fnzr vafgnag, naq
pnyyf frr gur gvzr va gur fnzr beqre va juvpu gurl ubyq gur ybpx. Vs lbh ernq gur pybpx sbe rnpu
fvyrapr vafvqr gur ybbc bs `Rkcver`, n snfg pybpx pbhyq whqtr 2 fvyraprf jvgu gur fnzr `Hagvy`
qvssreragyl va 1 pnyy.

Gur grfgf cnff n snxr pybpx (gur funcr bs 22-nyregfgngr'f, oruvaq vgf bja zhgrk orpnhfr gur
tbebhgvarf bs fgrc 5 ernq vg ng gur fnzr gvzr). Gur erny pybpx, `gvzr.Abj`, pneevrf n zbabgbavp
ernqvat, fb `Orsber` naq `Nsgre` ba 2 ernqvatf ner fnsr sebz AGC whzcf. Pbzcner gvzrf jvgu
`Orsber`, `Nsgre`, `Rdhny` be `Pbzcner`, arire jvgu `==`: `==` nyfb pbzcnerf gur ybpngvba naq gur
zbabgbavp ernqvat.

"Npgvir juvyr `abj < Hagvy`" vf n unys-bcra vagreiny: ng `Hagvy` vgfrys gur fvyrapr unf raqrq.
Vg vf gur fnzr pubvpr nf gur `>=` pbzcnevfbaf bs 22-nyregfgngr, jurer gur obhaqnel vafgnag pbhagf
nf "gur gvzr unf cnffrq". Va pbqr gung vf `abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy)`
sbe "npgvir" naq `!abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy)` sbe "raqrq". Jevgr gur ehyr va 1 cynpr, be gur 2 zrgubqf
gung arrq vg jvyy qvfnterr ng gur obhaqnel.

### Qryrgvat sebz n znc qhevat n enatr

Gur Tb fcrp nyybjf vg: "Vs n znc ragel gung unf abg lrg orra ernpurq vf erzbirq qhevat vgrengvba,
gur pbeerfcbaqvat vgrengvba inyhr jvyy abg or cebqhprq." Qryrgvat gur ragel lbh ner ybbxvat ng vf
nyjnlf fnsr. Fb gur ybbc gung pbyyrpgf raqrq fvyraprf pna qryrgr gurz va gur fnzr cnff. Ab frpbaq
fyvpr bs xrlf vf arrqrq. (Nqqvat ragevrf qhevat n enatr vf nyfb nyybjrq, ohg jurgure gur ybbc frrf
gur arj barf vf abg fcrpvsvrq. Qb abg qrcraq ba vg.)

### Znc beqre naq qrgrezvavfgvp erfhygf

`sbe vq, fvy := enatr z` ivfvgf gur ragevrf va na beqre gung punatrf sebz eha gb eha. Gung vf jul
`Zngpu` arrqf n gvr ehyr: 2 fvyraprf gung raq ng gur fnzr zbzrag jbhyq bgurejvfr jva va ghea, naq
gur nyreg HV jbhyq fubj n qvssrerag fvyrapr nsgre rirel erybnq. Naq vg vf jul `Rkcver` fbegf:
gur ba-pnyy punaary fubhyq ernq "qvfx-1 raqrq, qvfx-2 raqrq" va n fgnoyr beqre, naq n grfg pna
pbzcner gur erfhyg. Va 03-cntrabvfr lbh fbegrq jvgu `fyvprf.FbegShap` naq `pzc`; urer gur svefg
xrl vf n `gvzr.Gvzr`. `gvzr.Gvzr.Pbzcner` (Tb 1.20) ergheaf -1, 0 be +1 yvxr `pzc.Pbzcner`, naq
`pzc.Be` ergheaf vgf svefg aba-mreb nethzrag, juvpu tvirf "ol `Hagvy`, gura ol VQ" va 1 yvar.

### N pnyyonpx bhgfvqr gur ybpx

`flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag. N tbebhgvar gung ubyqf vg naq pnyyf `Ybpx` ntnva jnvgf sberire sbe
vgfrys. Fb vs `Rkcver` ubyqf gur ybpx juvyr vg pnyyf `baRkcver`, naq `baRkcver` pnyyf `Nqq` gb
rkgraq gur fvyrapr, `Rkcver` arire ergheaf. Tb ercbegf "nyy tbebhgvarf ner nfyrrc - qrnqybpx!"
bayl jura rirel tbebhgvar vf fghpx; va n freire jvgu bgure tbebhgvarf vg whfg unatf. Gung vf jul
gur grfg chgf n 5 f gvzrbhg nebhaq gur pnyy naq anzrf gur yvxryl pnhfr.

Gurer ner 2 zber ernfbaf gb pnyy sbervta pbqr bhgfvqr n ybpx, rira jura vg qbrf abg pnyy lbh
onpx:

- **Gvzr.** `baRkcver` cbfgf gb n pung freivpr. Vs gung gnxrf 2 f, rirel `Zngpu` va gur nyregvat
  cvcryvar jnvgf 2 f sbe gur ybpx.
- **Ybpx beqre.** Vs `baRkcver` gnxrf n ybpx bs vgf bja, naq nabgure tbebhgvar ubyqf gung ybpx
  juvyr vg pnyyf `Zngpu`, gur 2 tbebhgvarf jnvg sbe rnpu bgure.

Gur cnggrea: haqre gur ybpx, punatr gur fgngr naq pbyyrpg jung lbh bjr gur bhgfvqr jbeyq; eryrnfr
gur ybpx; gura qryvire. Jngpu `qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()`: vg ehaf jura gur shapgvba ergheaf, fb rirel
pnyy nsgre vg va gur fnzr shapgvba fgvyy ehaf haqre gur ybpx. Rvgure haybpx rkcyvpvgyl, be chg gur
ybpxrq cneg va n fznyy urycre gung hfrf `qrsre` naq ergheaf jung vg pbyyrpgrq. Gur urycre xrrcf
`qrsre`'f nqinagntr: n cnavp pnaabg yrnir gur ybpx uryq.

Pnyyvat bhgfvqr gur ybpx unf n pbafrdhrapr lbh fubhyq npprcg ba checbfr: jura `baRkcver` ehaf,
bgure tbebhgvarf znl nyernql unir punatrq gur fgber. `baRkcver` frrf n svavfurq punatr, abg n
sebmra fgber. Gung vf svar urer, orpnhfr gur pnyyonpx trgf gur fvyrapr nf n inyhr.

### Rknpgyl bapr

Orpnhfr gur erzbiny naq gur qrpvfvba "guvf bar raqrq" unccra va 1 pevgvpny frpgvba, rnpu raqrq
fvyrapr vf va gur erfhyg bs rknpgyl 1 `Rkcver` pnyy, rira jura 2 tbebhgvarf pnyy `Rkcver` ng gur
fnzr zbzrag. N irefvba gung svefg pbyyrpgf raqrq fvyraprf haqre gur ybpx, haybpxf, naq gura
qryrgrf gurz haqre n frpbaq ybpx yrgf 2 pnyyf obgu pbyyrpg gur fnzr fvyrapr: gur punaary urnef
gjvpr gung vg raqrq. Fgrc 5 purpxf "rknpgyl bapr" sbe rirel fvyrapr.

### Reebef jvgu `%j` naq `%d`

Nf va 06-frzire, gur reebe jencf n fragvary jvgu `%j` fb pnyyref pna grfg vg jvgu `reebef.Vf`, naq
dhbgrf gur vachg jvgu `%d` fb na rzcgl VQ fubjf hc nf `""` vafgrnq bs nf abguvat. Gur jbeqvat nsgre
gur fragvary vf sbe uhznaf: fnl juvpu ehyr snvyrq.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`baRkcver` haqre gur ybpx**, nyfb guebhtu `qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()` ng gur gbc bs `Rkcver`.
- **Ernqvat gur pybpx zber guna bapr cre pnyy**, be ernqvat vg orsber gur ybpx.
- **`<=` naq `<` zvkrq hc ng `Hagvy`.** `Zngpu` naq `Rkcver` zhfg nterr: n fvyrapr vf rvgure
  npgvir (zngpurf) be raqrq (erzbinoyr), arire obgu naq arire arvgure.
- **Gehfgvat znc beqre** sbe gur gvr va `Zngpu` be gur beqre bs `Rkcver`'f erfhyg. Grfgf jvgu 2 be
  3 fvyraprf znl cnff ol yhpx naq snvy ba gur arkg eha.
- **Erwrpgvat na `Nqq` nsgre punatvat gur znc.** Purpx svefg, gura fgber; na vainyvq ercynprzrag
  zhfg yrnir gur byq fvyrapr nf vg jnf.
- **Fgbevat n fvyrapr gung zngpurf rirelguvat** orpnhfr "gur hfre fheryl zrnag vg". Va cebqhpgvba
  guvf vf gur zbfg qnatrebhf fvyrapr gurer vf.
- **Ergheavat gur znc be n cbvagre vagb vg.** Urer `Fvyrapr` vf n inyhr jvgu ab fyvprf be zncf
  vafvqr, fb ergheavat vg pbcvrf vg; jvgu ersrerapr svryqf lbh jbhyq arrq gb pbcl gurz lbhefrys.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf Nyregznantre** fgberf fvyraprf jvgu zngpuref (rdhnyvgl be ertrk, ba nal ynory), n
  `fgnegfNg`, na `raqfNg`, n perngbe naq n pbzzrag. Vg erwrpgf n fvyrapr jubfr `raqfNg` vf orsber
  vgf `fgnegfNg`, naq n fvyrapr jubfr zngpuref jbhyq nyy zngpu na rzcgl ynory, fb n fvyrapr pnaabg
  zhgr rirelguvat ol nppvqrag. N fvyrapr vf craqvat orsber `fgnegfNg`, npgvir hagvy `raqfNg`, naq
  rkcverq nsgre. Nyregznantre xrrcf rkcverq fvyraprf sbe `--qngn.ergragvba` (120 u ol qrsnhyg),
  fb gur HV pna fubj gurz naq lbh pna erperngr bar; n znvagranapr wbo qryrgrf gurz nsgre gung.
  `nzgbby fvyrapr nqq` tvirf n fvyrapr 1 u jura lbh qb abg cnff `--qhengvba`.
- **Tensnan nyregvat** hfrf gur fnzr fvyrapr zbqry nf Nyregznantre.
- **CntreQhgl znvagranapr jvaqbjf** unir n erdhverq fgneg naq raq gvzr, naq gur freivprf gurl
  pbire qb abg perngr vapvqragf va orgjrra.
- **Gur "rkcvevat fbba" zrffntr.** Znal grnzf cbfg n erzvaqre orsber n fvyrapr raqf, jvgu n
  ohggba gb rkgraq vg. Gur rkgrafvba vf n arj `raqfNg` ba gur fnzr fvyrapr, juvpu vf gur
  "ercynpr ol VQ" bs guvf rkrepvfr.
- **Fpnyr.** Jvgu gubhfnaqf bs fvyraprf, n shyy enatr cre `Zngpu` trgf rkcrafvir, naq erny
  flfgrzf vaqrk gur fvyraprf, sbe rknzcyr ol nyreg anzr, be pnpur juvpu fvyraprf zngpurq juvpu
  nyreg. N fgber gung zhfg rkcver znal ragevrf xrrcf gurz va n zva-urnc beqrerq ol raq gvzr
  (`pbagnvare/urnc`), fb gur pyrnahc gbhpurf bayl gur ragevrf gung raqrq. Sbe n srj uhaqerq
  fvyraprf, gur znc naq gur enatr ner snfgre guna nal vaqrk.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

- **24-qhengvbaf** cnefrf `2q` naq `1j` vagb n `gvzr.Qhengvba`, fb gur fvyrapr gbby pna pbzchgr
  `Hagvy` sebz jung n uhzna glcrf.
- **33-engryvzvg** erzbirf cre-pyvrag engr yvzvgref gung abobql hfrq sbe n juvyr: rivpgvba ol
  vqyrarff vafgrnq bs ol na raq gvzr.
- **34-pnpur** pbzovarf n gvzr gb yvir jvgu n fvmr yvzvg naq pnyyf n pnyyonpx sbe rirel erzbiny,
  bhgfvqr gur ybpx, jvgu n ernfba. Vg vf guvf rkrepvfr jvgu 2 zber fgehpgherf gb xrrc va flap.
- **44-nyregtebhc** zngpurf nyregf ol ynoryf naq tebhcf gurz vagb abgvsvpngvbaf.
- **48-yrnqreryrpgvba** qrpvqrf jurgure n yrnfr unf rkcverq ntnvafg na vawrpgrq pybpx.

